---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Four projects by Jimmy Chen and what each one taught, from an open-source workflow for AI coding agents to tooling that connects agents to an accounting ledger.
permalink: /projects/
---
<section class="wrap page">
  <header class="page__head">
    <p class="label">Projects</p>
    <h1>Things I've built, and what they taught me</h1>
    <p class="section__lead">Feature lists age badly. The lesson usually doesn't.</p>
  </header>
  {%- for project in projects %}
  <article class="project" id="{{ project.id }}">
    <div class="project__side">
      <p class="label">{{ project.kind }}</p>
      <h2>{{ project.name }}</h2>
      {%- if project.link %}
      <p><a class="text-link" href="{{ project.link.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ project.link.label }}</a></p>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="project__body">
      <p class="project__summary">{{ project.summary }}</p>
      <p class="project__insight">{{ project.insight }}</p>
      {%- for paragraph in project.body %}
      <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
      {%- endfor %}
      <h3>What I took from it</h3>
      <ul>
        {%- for lesson in project.lessons %}
        <li>{{ lesson }}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
